{'symbol': 'CMS', 'date': '2022-02-23 10:30:00', 'title': 'CMS ENERGY NAMES CHRISTOPHER FULTZ VICE PRESIDENT OF GAS OPERATIONS', 'text': 'JACKSON, MICH., FEB. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CMS ENERGY AND ITS PRINCIPAL SUBSIDIARY CONSUMERS ENERGY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT CHRISTOPHER (CHRIS) FULTZ IS NAMED VICE PRESIDENT OF GAS OPERATIONS EFFECTIVE MARCH 1.'}